 proxygen futurednsresolutioncallback dnsresolver  resolutioncallback futurednsresolutioncallback  
      folly  promise std  vector dnsresolver  answer   promise  
        promise  std  move promise resolutionerror folly  exception wrapper  ew override   
    promise  setexception ew resolutionsuccess  
      std  vector dnsresolver  answer  answers override   
    promise  setvalue std  move answers folly  promise std  vector dnsresolver  answer   promise   
   
    
 
futurednsresolver  futurednsresolver folly  eventbase  evb  
                                     dnsresolver  uniqueptr resolver  
      evb  evb   resolver  std  move resolver     
  check ne cast folly  eventbase evb   
          eventbase must null   
  check ne cast dnsresolver resolver dns resolver must null   
  
 
futurednsresolver   futurednsresolver folly  future std  vector dnsresolver  answer   
futurednsresolver  resolveaddress folly  socketaddress  address  
                                  std  chrono  milliseconds timeout    
  folly  promise std  vector dnsresolver  answer   promise future   promise getfuture callback futurednsresolutioncallback std  move promise    
  evb - runineventbasethread  
       address  callback  resolver   resolver   timeout      
        resolver- resolveaddress callback  address  timeout future  
  
 
folly  future std  vector dnsresolver  answer   
futurednsresolver  resolvehostname std  string  name  
                                   std  chrono  milliseconds timeout  
                                   sa family t family  
                                   traceeventcontext tectx    
  folly  promise std  vector dnsresolver  answer   promise future   promise getfuture callback futurednsresolutioncallback std  move promise    
  evb - runineventbasethread  
       callback  family  name  resolver   resolver   tectx  timeout      
        resolver- resolvehostname callback  name  timeout  family  tectx future  
  
 
folly  future std  vector dnsresolver  answer   
futurednsresolver  resolvemailexchange std  string  domain  
                                       std  chrono  milliseconds timeout    
  folly  promise std  vector dnsresolver  answer   promise future   promise getfuture callback futurednsresolutioncallback std  move promise    
  evb - runineventbasethread  
       callback  domain  resolver   resolver   timeout      
        resolver- resolvemailexchange callback  domain  timeout future  
  
 
dnsresolver  statscollector  futurednsresolver  getstatscollector resolver - getstatscollector futurednsresolver  setstatscollector  
